<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>The aisle</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">PinkPantheress</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Heaven knows</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6SjxVgMjH3b3AI4wVviZfi</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.351" end="00:20.001">It's one of those unfortunate things (Things)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.001" end="00:23.533">That bad things always happen to me (To me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.533" end="00:27.148">And you don't want to keep the door open (Open)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:27.148" end="00:30.687">You wanted to see me full of emotion</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.687" end="00:33.881">I ruined all my friendships with you (With you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.881" end="00:37.442">And I think I'm runnin' out of people to lose (To lose)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.442" end="00:41.464">I only have to give you my motion</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.464" end="00:43.683">And you always find your way right back to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.683" end="00:45.183" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.338" end="00:46.048">This problem again (This problem again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.048" end="00:47.808">Look what I started (Look what I started)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.808" end="00:49.642">I lay in your bed (I lay in your bed)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.642" end="00:51.316">That's how it started (That's how it started)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.316" end="00:53.028">A little bit more (A little bit more)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.028" end="00:54.528">Of this mystery</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.254" end="00:57.306">I will make you wish that you had never come to me ('Cause)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.306" end="00:58.806" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:57.717" end="01:00.838">I picture you one day after you improve (Look what I started)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.838" end="01:03.052">And you're walkin' down the aisle (Walkin' down the aisle)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.052" end="01:04.898">It's a thing that makes me smile (That's how it started; Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.898" end="01:07.967">You lay in bed where you'd rather be instead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.967" end="01:10.204">No, you're not quite stuck with me (You're not quite stuck with me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:10.204" end="01:11.961">But one day you'll be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.961" end="01:13.461" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.255" end="01:16.929">So why can't I be romantic with you? (With you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.929" end="01:20.370">I'm guessin' there's something about the stuff we went through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.370" end="01:24.222">Now you'll never let me leave that behind us (Behind us)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.222" end="01:28.117">Leave it in California (California)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:28.117" end="01:31.288">This sticky situation with you (With you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.288" end="01:34.995">Make me stop booking all my tables for two (Two)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.995" end="01:38.799">I still refer to you as an option (Option)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.799" end="01:40.914">'Cause you'll always find your way right back to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.914" end="01:42.414" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.622" end="01:43.229">This problem again (This problem again)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.229" end="01:45.076">Look what I started (Look what I started)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:45.076" end="01:46.912">I lay in your bed (I lay in your bed)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.912" end="01:48.620">That's how it started (That's how it started)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.620" end="01:50.327">A little bit more (A little bit more)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:50.327" end="01:51.827">Of this mystery</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.348" end="01:54.541">I will make you wish that you had never come to me ('Cause)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.541" end="01:56.041" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:55.074" end="01:57.925">I picture you one day after you improve (Look what I started)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.925" end="02:00.343">And you're walkin' down the aisle (Walkin' down the aisle)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.343" end="02:02.033">It's a thing that makes me smile (That's how it started; Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.033" end="02:05.310">You lay in bed where'd you'd rather be instead</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.310" end="02:07.544">No, you're not quite stuck with me (You're not quite stuck with me)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.544" end="02:09.044">But one day you'll be</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.875" end="02:10.375" /><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:09.389" end="02:12.932">You can say you're sorry, do you ever really mean it?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:12.932" end="02:16.454">You and your Ferrari might just make you seem appealin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:16.454" end="02:20.169">Lookin' at your photos, when did your life get so quiet?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:20.169" end="02:24.169">Open up yours doors to me and I'll enter inside it (Yeah)</p></div></body></tt>